## Attribution guarantees

- Every `search` result is a Pydantic `SearchResult` with `title` + `url`.
- The writeback tool always emits a `## Sources` section — this is
  non-negotiable and mirrors Claude Code's `WebSearchTool` requirement.
- Verbatim excerpts ≥ 15 words that aren't quoted will raise a warning
  in the aggregate report.
